From 0be77e140a5a0e1d0c5142e248bcee0e768b040a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Koudai Aono <koxudaxi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 06:49:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] qwen35: the DFlash drafter

Loads a DFlash2 drafter, captures the target's features, keeps the drafter's K/V rings, runs its block graph and lattice walk, and saves its ring in the payload.

Upstream: not offered, fork only
Retire-when: upstream drives DFlash itself
